# Corners: rounded, not round

Unique OS is **rounded rectangles**, not circles or pills.

- Use `rounded-md` (10px) for controls, tiles, chips, icon buttons, badges, inputs.
- Use `rounded-lg` (14px) only for large media surfaces (hero tiles, lifestyle/feature cards, FinalCTA).
- **Never** use `rounded-full`, `rounded-pill`, or a 999px radius.
- Do not use `rounded-xl` for compact rows (48px tiles look circular). Prefer `rounded-md`.
- Theme tokens `--radius-full` and `--radius-xl` are capped at 10px; do not raise them.

```tsx
// BAD
<button className="rounded-full h-8 w-8" />
<a className="rounded-xl h-12" />

// GOOD
<button className="rounded-md h-8 w-8" />
<a className="rounded-md h-12 border ..." />
```
